// P3B.9 / X15 Replace instances on the flange stand-in with two more Part Studios
// (`fixtures/flange_replace.cadrs`: Flange <1> fixed, Screw <1> Fastened in the centre hole; a
// "Long Screw" with the same Ø0.25 in rim under a Ø0.4 in head and a 1.5 in shank; a plain Ø0.3 in
// "Dowel").
// 01 The Flange Assembly: Flange <1>, Screw <1>, Fastened 1.
// 02 Screw <1>'s menu: Replace instances…
// 03 The Replace instances dialog: Screw <1> to replace; every part of the document to choose from,
//    with thumbnails.
// 04 Long Screw chosen: "Mates kept: 1" (its rim under the head matches the screw's).
// 05 ✓: Long Screw <1> where the screw was, its longer shank under the flange; Fastened 1 kept
//    (its connector is now on the Long Screw's rim).
// 06 Replace again with the Dowel: "Mates kept: 0 · removed (no matching geometry): Fastened 1".
// 07 ✓: Dowel <1>; Fastened 1 removed, as the toast says.
// 08 Undo, undo: the screw is back with Fastened 1.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        Wait(10),
        Custom("fixture flange_replace"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("tab-flange-assembly")),
        Wait(10),
        Custom("view 25 25 0 0 -5 0.13"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-x15-flange-assembly"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-2")),
        WaitFor("asm-replace"),
        Hover(ui("asm-replace")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-x15-replace-instances-menu"),
        Click(ui("asm-replace")),
        WaitFor("replace-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-x15-replace-dialog"),
        Click(ui("replace-part-long-screw")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-x15-long-screw-mates-kept"),
        Click(ui("replace-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-x15-replaced-mate-kept"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-2")),
        WaitFor("asm-replace"),
        Click(ui("asm-replace")),
        WaitFor("replace-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("replace-part-dowel")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-x15-dowel-mate-removed"),
        Click(ui("replace-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-x15-dowel-no-mate"),
        Key("Ctrl+Z"),
        Wait(5),
        Key("Ctrl+Z"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1300, 250),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-x15-undone-screw-back"),
    ],
)
